// for a process bank.
// Its layout is word 0 the jump to the start, 020-077 the translator's words, 0100-0107
// the system call frame, the routines' returns and the constants from 0110 (laid down at
// the end), then the program.
// 23-Nov-2026, Claude: comments cleaned for the release.
#include "unixsys.ah"
// by hand: the 340's command words, for the display (psych.s's list, rewritten below)
