// the count left 0.
// That word runs at the second character typed after button 6 (a first other than "a" or
// a new line).
// On the PDP-7 it is a bad system call (s3.s:89), where the read's descriptor was to be
// cleared; on the PDP-1 an instruction it lacks, which halts the machine.
// The count is u_9f, as the program meant.
// And first the buttons are read, by h_rdpb.
